# c158 deck (R-186 item 3 Step A, user-approved 2026-10-30): Michel accretion in Cartesian Kerr-Schild (a = 0), AthenaK's GR hydro
# module (the HARM form T^t_t + D, ideal_c2p_hyd.hpp:259-266), pgen gr_bondi; B.2's Michel (r_c = 8 M areal, rho_c = 1e-8 at r_c,
# Gamma = 5/3: k_adi = T_c/rho_c^(2/3)), B.2's mesh (../c150_rframe/B2A_val_L2.par: root dx = 1 on +-64, static boxes +-32/16/8/4,
# 16^3 MeshBlocks), its ppmx + hlle + rk3, cfl 0.4, nghost 4, FOFC, floors dfloor 1e-24, pfloor = dfloor*tfloor.
# Not matched: excision at r_KS <= 1 (hard-coded rexcise, coordinates.cpp:69-70; alpha = 0.577 there), the boundary (gr_bondi's
# FixedBondiInflow on the box faces, not B.2's hold at r_iso >= 40), no dual-energy/atmosphere-zone machinery (B.2 had them off).
<comment>
problem = Michel accretion in Kerr-Schild (Step A, level L2)
<job>
basename = ks_michel
<mesh>
nghost = 4
nx1 = 128
x1min = -64.0
x1max = 64.0
ix1_bc = user
ox1_bc = user
nx2 = 128
x2min = -64.0
x2max = 64.0
ix2_bc = user
ox2_bc = user
nx3 = 128
x3min = -64.0
x3max = 64.0
ix3_bc = user
ox3_bc = user
<meshblock>
nx1 = 16
nx2 = 16
nx3 = 16
<mesh_refinement>
refinement = static
num_levels = 3
max_nmb_per_rank = 400

<refined_region1>
level = 1
x1min = -32.0
x1max = 32.0
x2min = -32.0
x2max = 32.0
x3min = -32.0
x3max = 32.0

<refined_region2>
level = 2
x1min = -16.0
x1max = 16.0
x2min = -16.0
x2max = 16.0
x3min = -16.0
x3max = 16.0

<coord>
general_rel = true
a = 0.0
excise = true
dexcise = 1.0e-24
pexcise = 1.0e-46
<time>
evolution = dynamic
integrator = rk3
cfl_number = 0.4
nlim = -1
tlim = 120.0
ndiag = 100
<hydro>
eos = ideal
reconstruct = ppmx
rsolver = hlle
fofc = true
gamma = 1.6666666666666667
dfloor = 1.0e-24
pfloor = 1.0e-46
<problem>
pgen_name = gr_bondi
k_adi = 11240.528817557646
r_crit = 8.0
<output1>
file_type = hst
dt = 0.5
data_format = %20.15e
<output2>
file_type = bin
variable = hydro_w
dt = 40.0
id = prim_3d
<output3>
file_type = rst
dcycle = 500
